lse, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiN9jef", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 47, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8945425, "raw_content": "", "author": "Justlooking250", "created": 1795027864642, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Twobuck40", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToiN9jef.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/NowPammsy/status/2122890448180015535?a=u2LbI3dt2A2Y2yc2c6g&s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Civilian Unrest Negotiation Team", "last_comment_created": 1795034868088, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 47, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 626, "created": 1794971498000, "id": "2122890448180015535", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122890315073728512/img/bUFtwnWycApWmAb7.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122890315073728512/pl/SKirQKBq538LMgFk.m3u8?v=9ca", "aspectRatio": [9, 16], "heightRatio": 177, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122890315073728512/vid/avc1/320x568/ScKkq2bag1acLa8g.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2093948613583933440/lsliaMYe_normal.jpg", "displayName": "PammsyNow", "username": "NowPammsy"}, "content": "Ok I\u2019m sorry\u2026. you can\u2019t make this sh*t  up!  \ud83e\udd23\ud83e\udd23\ud83e\udd23\ud83e\udd23\ud83e\udd23\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude05\n\nSMH \ud83e\udd26\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Let\u2019s hope this is satire! \ud83d\ude05", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 8162}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToiNA1Ab", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 27, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8945595, "raw_content": "---\nListen to what this lady says on the Drill Down w/ Peter Schweitzer\n\n\n# ***Heather Honey, senior counselor to Homeland Security Secretary Markwayne Mullin, joins Peter Schweizer and Eric Eggers to walk through the numbers.***\n\n7 minutes in, Heather spills the beans\n\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udMzBLMHwNY&t=430s\n\n\n> The Defense Production Act of 1950 (DPA) is allowed when the president\u2014or designated officials\u2014determines that an action is necessary to support national defense, emergency preparedness, or critical infrastructure. Under the law, \"national defense\" is broadly defined to cover military programs, energy production, homeland security, stockpiling, space, assistance to allied nations, and disaster response or recovery.\n\nBOOM\n\nNational / Homeland Security and Critical infrastructure.\n\nOur elections are critical infrastructure.\n\nAnd they are also the purview of national security\n\nTrump can use this act to compel the NGOs to produce this information while the DOJ is in litigation, and completely bypass this delay\n\nIt should be something that is continuous\n\nHow DARE the dem states share with private companies and not the US Government!\n\n", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1795038349630, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "greatpumpkin", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Blue States are litigating against the DOJ for the voter rolls.  However, those same states are sharing that same info w/ NGOs to feed into NGP-VAN their voting demo software.  Trump should use DEFENSE PRODUCTION ACT to seize this info from NGOs", "last_comment_created": 1795039156945, "content": "<hr />\n<p>Listen to what this lady says on the Drill Down w/ Peter Schweitzer</p>\n<h1><em><strong>Heather Honey, senior counselor to Homeland Security Secretary Markwayne Mullin, joins Peter Schweizer and Eric Eggers to walk through the numbers.</strong></em></h1>\n<p>7 minutes in, Heather spills the beans</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udMzBLMHwNY&amp;t=430s\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udMzBLMHwNY&amp;t=430s</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Defense Production Act of 1950 (DPA) is allowed when the president\u2014or designated officials\u2014determines that an action is necessary to support national defense, emergency preparedness, or critical infrastructure. Under the law, &quot;national defense&quot; is broadly defined to cover military programs, energy production, homeland security, stockpiling, space, assistance to allied nations, and disaster response or recovery.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>BOOM</p>\n<p>National / Homeland Security and Critical infrastructure.</p>\n<p>Our elections are critical infrastructure.</p>\n<p>And they are also the purview of national security</p>\n<p>Trump can use this act to compel the NGOs to produce this information while the DOJ is in litigation, and completely bypass this delay</p>\n<p>It should be something that is continuous</p>\n<p>How DARE the dem states share with private companies and not the US Government!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 27, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "